# REPRODUCTION for bead inc-akac, rebuilt by inc-b4l3g.2: a LOADED orc priest of
# Khasrach with the Pain domain (Feed upon Pain, ability level 1) punches a
# summoned shrieker standing next to him. Load
# tools/fixtures/chars/orc-priest-pain-seed1-sneakopts.sav (INCURSION_LOAD); its
# key script tools/keys/pain-priest-wounded-save.keys says how he was made:
# empty weapon hand (so he brawls, Punch 1d3+3, always <= 10 damage), about 30
# of 36 hit points (so a heal is never capped at max HP), and a tally of 5.
# Read with tools/check_feed_upon_pain.sh via logs/pain.log
# (INCURSION_PAIN_PROBE=1). A shrieker (lib/mon3.irh) makes noise, not damage;
# the extra RIGHTs after it dies only walk the priest east.
@dump:start

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Fungi"
@choose "shrieker"
RIGHT ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
@dump:victim

RIGHT
@while "Die?" n
RIGHT
@while "Die?" n
RIGHT
@while "Die?" n
RIGHT
@while "Die?" n
@dump:end

@quit
